75
00:04:58.715 --> 00:05:02.682
As I lay back down, I realized something.

76
00:05:02.683 --> 00:05:04.767
Tate was right.

77
00:05:04.768 --> 00:05:15.492
Being a big brother was a lot harder than I had thought.

